#X text 20 50 NAME tessera;
#X text 20 75 AUTHOR Sofia Vallejo Budziszewski;
#X text 20 100 DESCRIPTION Classic synth architectures and creative effects for Pd vanilla: ten synths (DX7 TX81Z Minimoog SH-101 Prophet-5 Alpha Juno B-3 MS-20 CZ-101 Mellotron) and seven effects: spectral freeze smear gate cross and a pitch-aware granulator and a modal resonator bank and data modulators (CSV and Lorenz and Henon and cellular automata);
